# Client News Crawler — local environment (copy to .env, gitignored)
#
# S_DRIVE_ROOT: local path on Ubuntu backing the Windows S: share.
# The crawler writes raw archive + KB scaffold here:
#   <S_DRIVE_ROOT>/<client>/<category>/<date>.json     (raw archive)
#   <S_DRIVE_ROOT>/Obsidian/<client>/KB/                (KB scaffold)
# On theeggsh's box this is the AI-Report shared folder:
S_DRIVE_ROOT=/media/theeggsh/SSD-2/AI-Report
